if someone finds your paper words.␀␀CREATE PASSPHRASE␀␀␀7511c6e␀0.1.0-beta3␀KISS %s (%s)␀␀␀␀ENABLED␀-  flash encryption: %s␀OFF␀NOT HELD␀␀␀␀-  radio: %s␀␀␀␀held in reset␀␀␀6␀␀␀7␀␀␀9␀␀␀'␀␀␀;␀␀␀[␀␀␀]␀␀␀{␀␀␀*␀␀␀<␀␀␀>␀␀␀\␀␀␀|␀␀␀`␀␀␀~␀␀␀^␀␀␀!␀␀␀@␀␀␀#␀␀␀$␀␀␀%␀␀␀&␀␀␀-␀␀␀=␀␀␀+␀␀␀,␀␀␀U␀␀␀I␀␀␀J␀␀␀Z␀␀␀X␀␀␀w␀␀␀i␀␀␀a␀␀␀f␀␀␀j␀␀␀v␀␀␀b␀␀␀ï”␀FINGERPRINT␀ONLINE APP␀␀ï” QR ï“␀␀KISS OFFLINE␀␀␀␀%llu.%08llu␀%llu␀␀␀␀MONO␀␀␀␀GREEN␀␀␀CYPHERPINK␀␀ORANGE␀␀copy them onto paper, in order. never a photo, never a file.␀␀␀␀BACKUP WORDS␀␀␀␀%2d. %s␀DONE␀␀␀␀phone apps that read a key (zpub): BlueWallet
